= Overview

Effective February 15, 2026, all forms of prayer, invocation, or metaphysical petition are *strictly forbidden* within Teleport Massive facilities.

#showybox(
  frame: (border-color: tm-blue, body-color: tm-blue.lighten(95%)),
  title: "Important Note",
