  This policy is not a commentary on religion or spirituality. It is a *safety protocol* based on scientific observations.
]

= The Scientific Basis

Our research has revealed an unexpected relationship between focused intentional thought and quantum systems.

== Observation 1: Intention Affects Quantum States

In controlled experiments, we observed that focused intention — particularly the kind associated with prayer — measurably affects quantum coherence.

